msgid "版本与发布记录"
msgstr "Versions and Release History"

msgid ""
"当前版本来自 ``configs/build-version``。本目录归档 ReliefNT 自身的发布说明； 原始正文、标签和源码保存在 `GitHub Releases "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/releases>`_。"
msgstr ""
"The current version comes from ``configs/build-version``. This directory archives ReliefNT's own "
"release notes; original bodies, tags, and source are available at `GitHub Releases "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/releases>`_."

msgid ""
"历史说明保留发布时的功能范围、迁移要求、验证结果与已知限制，不代表当前 版本状态。旧文档链接固定到对应发布标签，历史命令和路径不作为现行使用指南。 新版本按 "
":doc:`../process/releasing` 归档。"
msgstr ""
"Historical notes preserve feature scope, migration requirements, validation results, and known "
"limitations at release time, not current status. Old documentation links are pinned to their "
"release tags; historical commands and paths are not current usage instructions. Archive new "
"versions according to :doc:`../process/releasing`."
